Third-party components:
The model weights are a fine-tuned version of the NVVSpeech Challenge Track-2 baseline
(https://huggingface.co/NVVSpeech-Challenge/NVVSpeech-Challenge-Track2-Baseline, Apache-2.0),
which is itself fine-tuned from VoxCPM2 (https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM2, Apache-2.0).
Modification (2026-11): continued training of all weights for 400 steps with a distilled tag-contrastive
flow-matching target (see README). The Apache License 2.0 of these upstream models is reproduced in
LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 in the model repository. Inference uses the voxcpm package (Apache-2.0) unchanged;
it is installed from PyPI and not redistributed here.
